    /// The terminal turn result. Pushed by the driver after the `PromptResponse`
    /// arrives, carrying the mapped `Update::Done`. Always the last event on a
    /// turn that the agent COMPLETED (incl. a real `StopReason::Cancelled`).
    Done(Update),

